Analytical functions implemented in RefMetaPlant
The function ‘Browse Metabolome’ allows users to browse the reference metabolome of selected plant species and further drill into the details of each metabolite, including its formula, classification, 2D/3D structure, exact mass, SMILES, spectra and related metadata, etc. (Figure
3A
). The sample and analytical method information of each plant species can also be found from ‘metadata’ link in the ‘species metabolite’ page. In addition, the reference metabolome of selected plant species can be downloaded in files (two different formats: .msr or .mgf format) via the function ‘Share data’.
